{1}{"Grevious errors in judgement..."  That's what you call the horror that you visited upon Vendigroth?  Upon all of Arcanum? }{"Grevious errors in judgement..."  That's what you call the horror that you visited upon Vendigroth?  Upon all of Arcanum? }{}{1}{}{}
